    {
      "Trigger": "BossDead",
      "Room": null,
      "Line": {
        "Text": "Her nest breaks apart and goes down with the water: the second great drain runs. Back up the Gut the standing water drops, the air clears, and above you the shaking eases. Two great drains to go.",
